y<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">🚫 Limited<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">✔ Up to 80 tonnes<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">Surface<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">🚫 Unstable<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">✔ Joined by connectors to keep a firm platform<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">Weather Resistent<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">🚫<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">✔<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">Safety<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">🚫 Hazardous, Easily cracks<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">✔ Durable Material<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n    <tr>\n      <th style=\"background-color: lightgray;\">Maintenance<\/th>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">🚫<\/td>\n      <td style=\"text-align: center;\">✔ Easy to Clean, Washable<\/td>\n    <\/tr>\n  <\/tbody>\n<\/table>","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}},"f1c3463c-e4dd-47ba-adae-253eda1d0311":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_3_image.value }}","link":"","width":"100%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["template--14498159001729__edc0ad68-a6be-412e-9659-c3c61b75e10e-168494579725b2471c-1","f1c3463c-e4dd-47ba-adae-253eda1d0311"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":true}},"70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.text_columns_with_images_image_1.value }}","image_width":650,"title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.text_columns_with_images_image_2.value }}","image_width":650,"title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}},"template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-3":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.text_columns_with_images_image_3.value }}","image_width":650,"title":"","text":"","button_label":"","button_link":""}}},"block_order":["template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-1","template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-2","template--14527890292865__70650b4c-baf2-4654-9d73-cf6692dc3cc0-text_block-3"],"settings":{"title":"See our ground protection mats Transforming These SITES","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"f220664d-cc7b-4aea-a660-b60af2d6dd55":{"type":"featured-collection","settings":{"title":"See all our ground protection mats here","home_featured_products":"deck-products","per_row":4,"rows":1,"mobile_scrollable":true,"view_all":false,"divider":false}},"product-recommendations":{"type":"product-recommendations","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_product_recommendations":true,"product_recommendations_heading":"You may also like","related_count":5}},"98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c":{"type":"faq","blocks":{"template--14498159001729__98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c-16850334293c1835df-0":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"How do these ground protection mats protect your expensive turf?","text":"<p>Ground Protection Mats help spread out the weight of wheels and equipment. This stops them from sinking into the ground and damaging the grass. One big problem for grass is when the soil gets packed down too tightly. Viper Deck Protection mats help avoid this problem because they cover a wide area.<\/p>"}},"template--14498159001729__98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c-16850334293c1835df-1":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"What is the weight capacity of the ground protection mats?","text":"<p>Ground Protection Mats are tested to handle pressure up to 210 psi, which means they can safely carry heavy weights of up to 80 tons. They work well on grassy fields, sandy areas, and mixed stone surfaces for different uses.<\/p>"}},"f1e6822d-3e21-4028-bb57-612c9a43439e":{"type":"question","settings":{"title":"Can I drive and use the Ground Protection Mats?","text":"<p>Yes, you can use our ground  Protection Mats on the ground, for protection and stability for all kinds of vehicles and loads. This includes big trucks, forklifts, backhoes, pickup trucks, and other heavy machines.<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["template--14498159001729__98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c-16850334293c1835df-0","template--14498159001729__98e028a1-601b-4c5d-b26b-fc597b6d3a0c-16850334293c1835df-1","f1e6822d-3e21-4028-bb57-612c9a43439e"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"FAQs"}},"e4d9e90b-01c3-4c2a-8f70-5303e18201e1":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_3_heading.value }}","text":"<p>{{ product.metafields.custom.image_text_3_description | metafield_tag }}<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"{{ product.metafields.custom.promotion_grid_banner_image_1.value }}","focal_point":"center","layout":"right","height":550,"framed":false,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"49e1522d-4e00-4356-91df-3d3dbada5a3e":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/4_way_connector_1800x1800_4816ff7d-0dd0-43e5-8312-27b75dd7be5a.webp","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"VIPER DECK 500 CONNECTORS","text":"<p>Available in 2 Prong single connectors or 4 Prong double connectors configurations, these connectors are used to hold the Viper Deck mats in place during deployment to ensure a secure fit and stronger traction. <\/p>","button_label":"BUY CONNECTORS","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/viper-deck-500-connectors","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"7832703d-d5ca-4bdf-adbc-6260488743e0":{"type":"contact-form","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"title":"Questions, Inquiries, & Custom Quotes","text":"<p>For any questions, inquiries, or to get a quote on our Ground Protection Mats for your project, feel free to contact us below.<\/p>","show_phone":false,"narrow_column":true}},"16808712840b63fa95":{"type":"apps","blocks":{"7c9bb0fe-699c-4847-af7f-b7a00e6c190c":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/reviews\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}}},"block_order":["7c9bb0fe-699c-4847-af7f-b7a00e6c190c"],"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":true}},"e98b186a-cb19-48cb-8775-57d1b1ee5ebe":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1":{"type":"heading","settings":{"title":"FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS"}},"c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55":{"type":"text","settings":{"enlarge_text":true,"text":"<p><a href=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-bigfoot-outrigger-pads\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/pages\/frequently-asked-questions-bigfoot-outrigger-pads\"><strong>Got Questions? Learn more about our Bigfoot Outrigger Pads ❗HERE<\/strong><\/a>❗<\/p>"}}},"block_order":["19395395-ab98-4ad2-8cb6-274c48ffe6a1","c2c28a4a-2065-470b-9375-0248492fed55"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"recently-viewed":{"type":"recently-viewed","settings":{"recent_count":5}},"collection-return":{"type":"collection-return","settings":{}}},"order":["main","promo_grid_9GNKjm","sub","text-and-image2","69c6821c-9962-4685-a